# Binary files must never go through line-ending normalization.
# core.autocrlf=true (common on Windows) will otherwise convert LF -> CRLF on
# checkout for any file git doesn't detect as binary, silently corrupting
# byte-offset-sensitive formats like PDF (broken xref tables) and Parquet.
# Discovered 2026-09-05: docs/paper.pdf was corrupted this way on disk.
*.pdf     binary
*.parquet binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.ico     binary
*.ttf     binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary
*.zip     binary
